      "text": "[ K-IG 교육 Reading 231 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Would a modern music composer be your first choice for a hero? Or would you"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "think of the painter of a contemporary masterpiece? If you are like most people,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "the answer to both questions is “no.” More likely, a sports hero or a movie"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "star would be your first choice. It seems that the worlds of contemporary art"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and music have failed to offer people works that reflect human achievements."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "People, therefore, have lost interest in modern arts and have turned to sports"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "stars and other popular figures to find their role models."
    },
